{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"Service. Is never fair.\" Cato knows this will push everyone further away from him, but he must keep them alive","created_at":"2020-08-08T00:19:05.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741450377223995452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"When we were on the sub, and everyone was keeping secrets and hurting each other, Daysong never gave up. Even when he found out about Goanhawe. He knew they we're part of the Golden Dawn, but even then he just wanted to help him get back on the right path. Why do you think he's a Mason now? He never gave up of any of them, even when they might have been working directly against him and all of us. And...\" Leaf pauses for a moment, before recomposing herself, standing a bit taller. \"I know what it's like to be hunted. What it does to you. That kind of fear and mistrust, it changes you. Why do you think it took so long for me to come to London? I was ready to turn around and go back to the woods at the first sign of someone being like I thought people were. Scary, angry, hateful. But that's not what I found. You all prove me wrong. That's why I'm here. So if there's even a small chance we can do the same for them, we have to.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T00:26:56.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741452354922217563","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"They are followers of the Hunger. They worships it on the day of the black sun. They are part of the reason Melora is lost. Leaf. I respect you, but they tried to kill us. Goan never killed anyone himself. I am afraid it is the decision I am forced to make. Know that I do not do it lightly.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T00:29:53.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741453095401422938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"would you risk the 150 people in this town's life on that gamble?  Daysong had a knack for seeing the best in people, because he could see the future.... what if his sacrifice was to give us a chance at defending ourselves?  Ultimately this is Cato's call.... and I agree with what you are saying.... but This might be our only chance to end the blight they have put on us.....  so Leaf... who believes in the best in people.... would you risk all our lives on that glimmer of a possibility?\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T00:30:09.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741453161071509514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
